('128.21.b.8.C',3,'The climax of a plot is:','["the opening scene", "the turning point of greatest tension", "the title", "the final sentence only"]'::jsonb,1,'The climax is the peak of the conflict.','original'),
('128.21.b.8.C',3,'Falling action occurs:','["at the very start", "in the title", "after the climax as conflict winds down", "before the setting"]'::jsonb,2,'Falling action follows the climax.','original'),
('128.21.b.8.D',3,'A historical setting such as wartime can influence a character by:','["ending the story", "removing all problems", "erasing the plot", "forcing choices tied to danger or scarcity"]'::jsonb,3,'Setting shapes decisions.','original'),
('128.21.b.8.D',3,'A cultural setting influences the plot when characters:','["act according to their community''s traditions", "ignore everyone", "are not described", "never speak"]'::jsonb,0,'Culture shapes behavior.','original'),
('128.21.b.9.A',3,'A story with believable characters and events that could happen is:','["a tall tale", "realistic fiction", "a fable with talking animals", "a myth"]'::jsonb,1,'Realistic fiction could really happen.','original'),
('128.21.b.9.A',3,'An adventure story typically features:','["only a recipe", "a tax form", "a quest or dangerous journey", "a glossary"]'::jsonb,2,'Adventure centers on a journey.','original'),
('128.21.b.9.B',3,'A line break in a poem can:','["raise the page count", "end every poem", "delete a word", "create emphasis or a pause"]'::jsonb,3,'Line breaks shape meaning.','original'),
